        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Sphereland; Flatland\n- People: Dionys Burger; Edwin Abbott Abbott; A Square\n- Companies: Seeley & Co.\n- Places: London\n- Topics: sequels; publication\n\nFacts:\n- In 1884, Edwin Abbott Abbott first published Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions through Seeley & Co. in London.\n- Edwin Abbott Abbott was an English schoolmaster and wrote Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions under the pen name A Square.\n- Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions is a satirical novella.\n- In 1965, Dionys Burger published Sphereland: A Fantasy About Curved Spaces and an Expanding Universe.\n- Sphereland: A Fantasy About Curved Spaces and an Expanding Universe is a sequel to Flatland.",
